      "message": "Obviously we have a namespace conflict between Zephyr Kconfig and platform/ec config that\u0027s giving us a little greif.\n\nInstead of refactoring platform/ec to align with the way zephyr does things, let\u0027s do it the other way:\n\n1. Make a hidden kconfig CONFIG_FLASH_SIZE_KB, which defaults to FLASH_SIZE * 1000 in platform/ec Kconfig.\n2. In zephyr/shim/include/config_chip.h, undef CONFIG_FLASH_SIZE and def it to CONFIG_FLASH_SIZE_KB.\n\nSeems slightly less risky than this change?",
